hadiths[54]{hadithnumber,text}:
"607","[AI-translation] Salim se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum chand dekho to roza rakho, aur jab use dekho to iftar karo. Phir agar tum par badal ho to andaza laga lo.' Aur Abdullah hilal se ek din pahle roza rakhte. Ibrahim bin Sa'd se kaha gaya: Woh is se aage badhta hai. Unhon ne kaha: Han."
"608","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Dinar se, Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Maheena untees din ka hota hai. To chand dekhe baghair roza na rakho aur use dekhe baghair iftar na karo. Phir agar tum par badal ho to ginti tees poori kar lo.'"
"609","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Maheene se ek din aur na do din pahle roza na rakho siwae is ke ke woh din ho jis mein tum mein se koi roza rakhta ho. Is ke dekhne par roza rakho aur is ke dekhne par iftar karo. Phir agar tum par badal ho to tees gino.'"
"610","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ramazan se ek din aur na do din pahle roza na rakho siwae us aadmi ke jo roza rakhta ho, to woh rakhe.'"
"611","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe un par ta'ajjub hai jo maheene se pahle roza rakhte hain, halanke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use dekhe baghair roza na rakho aur use dekhe baghair iftar na karo.'"
"612","[AI-translation] Husain ki beti ki maa se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Ali ke paas Ramazan ke chand dekhne par gawahi di. To unhon ne roza rakha, aur mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Aur logon ko roza rakhne ka hukm diya. Aur unhon ne kaha: Main Sha'ban ka ek din roza rakhun yeh mujhe Ramazan ka ek din iftar karne se zyada pasand hai. Shafi'i ne is ke baad kaha: Ramazan par do gawahon ke siwa jaiz nahin."
"613","[AI-translation] Humaid bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se riwayat hai ke Umar aur Usman Maghrib ki namaz padhte jab kali raat dekhte, phir namaz ke baad iftar karte. Aur woh Ramazan mein tha."
"614","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Log hamesha bhalai mein rahenge jab tak iftar mein jaldi karen.'"
"615","[AI-translation] Salim se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak Bilal raat mein azan kahta hai. To khao aur piyo yahan tak ke Ibn Umm Maktum pukare.' Woh nabina aadmi the jo azan na kahte yahan tak ke un se kaha jata: Tum ne subah kar li, tum ne subah kar li."
"616","[AI-translation] Salim se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak Bilal raat mein pukarta hai. To khao aur piyo yahan tak ke Ibn Umm Maktum pukare.' Woh nabina aadmi the jo pukarte nahin the yahan tak ke un se kaha jata: Tum ne subah kar li, tum ne subah kar li."
"617","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se, Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Fath wale saal mein Ramazan ke maheene mein Makkah ke safar mein roza rakha, aur logon ko iftar ka hukm diya. To un se kaha gaya: Beshak logon ne roza rakha jab Aap ne roza rakha. To Aap ne pani ka bartan mangwaya aur use apne hath par rakha aur jo Aap ke aage the unhen rukne ka hukm diya. Jab woh ruk gae aur jo peeche the woh mil gae to Aap ne bartan ko apne munh tak uthaya aur piya. In donon ki hadees mein ya in ke siwa ki hadees mein hai: Aur woh asr ke baad tha."
"618","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se, Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah se nikle yahan tak ke Kura' Ghamim mein pahunche jabke Aap rozedar the. Phir Aap ne bartan uthaya aur use apne hath par rakha jabke Aap sawari par the. To Aap ne jo aage the unhen roka aur jo peeche the woh mil gae, phir piya jabke log dekh rahe the."
"619","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fath wale saal mein Ramazan mein nikle. To Aap ne roza rakha yahan tak ke Kadeed pahunche, phir iftar kiya aur logon ne Aap ke sath iftar kiya. Aur woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hukm mein se nae se nae ko lete the."
"620","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba mein se baaz se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Fath wale saal mein apne safar mein logon ko iftar ka hukm diya aur farmaya: 'Apne dushman ke muqable ke liye taqat hasil karo.' Aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne roza rakha. Unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr yani Ibn Abdur Rahman ne kaha: Mujhe jis ne bayan kiya us ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Arj mein apne sar par pyaas ya garmi ki wajah se pani dalte dekha. To kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Logon mein se ek giroh ne roza rakha jab Aap ne roza rakha. Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Kadeed mein pahunche to Aap ne pyala mangwaya aur piya aur logon ne iftar kiya."
"621","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se, Jabir se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fath wale saal mein Ramazan mein Makkah ki taraf nikle. To Aap ne roza rakha yahan tak ke Kura' Ghamim pahunche aur logon ne Aap ke sath roza rakha. To un se kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Logon par roza bhari ho gaya hai. To Aap ne asr ke baad pani ka pyala mangwaya, phir piya jabke log dekh rahe the. To baaz logon ne iftar kiya aur baaz ne roza rakha. Aap tak pahunchi ke logon ne roza rakha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh nafarman hain.'"
"622","[AI-translation] Siqah se, Darawardi se, Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se, Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fath wale saal mein Ramazan mein Makkah ki taraf nikle. To Aap ne roza rakha aur logon ko iftar ka hukm diya aur farmaya: 'Apne dushman ke muqable ke liye taqat hasil karo.' To kaha gaya: Logon ne iftar karne se inkar kiya jab Aap ne roza rakha. To Aap ne pani ka pyala mangwaya aur piya, phir hadees aage bayan ki."
"623","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Sa'd bin Mu'az se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jabir bin Abdullah ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ghazwa Tabuk ke zamane mein the. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) chasht ke baad chal rahe the jab Aap ek darakht ke sae mein ek jama'at ke paas the. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh kaisi jama'at hai?' Unhon ne kaha: Ek rozedar aadmi hai, roze ne use thaka diya hai, ya is jaise kalima. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Safar mein roza rakhna neki mein se nahin.'"
"624","[AI-translation] Shafwan bin Abdullah se, Umm Darda se, Ka'b bin Aasim Ash'ari se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Safar mein roza rakhna neki nahin.'"
"625","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Hamzah bin Amr Aslami ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main safar mein roza rakhun? Woh kasrat se roza rakhte. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar tum chaho to roza rakho, agar tum chaho to iftar karo.'"
"626","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Ramazan mein safar kiya. To rozedar ne iftar karne wale par etiraz na kiya aur iftar karne wale ne rozedar par etiraz na kiya."
"627","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath safar kiya. Ham mein se rozedar the aur iftar karne wale. To rozedar ne iftar karne wale par etiraz na kiya aur iftar karne wale ne rozedar par etiraz na kiya."
"628","[AI-translation] Urwah se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Aashura ka roza rakhte aur is ke roze ka hukm dete."
"629","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aashura ka din tha jis mein Quraish zamana jahiliyat mein roza rakhte. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) zamana jahiliyat mein is mein roza rakhte. Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah tashreef lae to Aap ne roza rakha aur is ke roze ka hukm diya. Jab Ramazan farz hua to wahi farz hua aur Aashura chhod diya. Jo chahe roza rakhe, jo chahe chhod de."
"630","[AI-translation] Humaid bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Mu'awiyah bin Abi Sufyan ko Aashura ke din suna jabke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke mimbar par the aur unhon ne apni aasteen se ek mutthi baal nikali aur kaha: Aey Madinah walon! Tumhare ulama kahan hain? Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko is jaise se mana farmate suna aur farmaya: 'Bani Isra'il tab halak hue jab in ki aurton ne use liya.' Phir unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko is jaise din mein farmate suna: 'Main rozedar hun, tum mein se jo chahe roza rakhe.'"
"631","[AI-translation] Humaid bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Mu'awiyah bin Abi Sufyan ko us saal suna jab unhon ne hajj kiya jabke woh mimbar par the kahte: Aey Madinah walon! Tumhare ulama kahan hain? Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko is jaise din Aashura ke din mein farmate suna: 'Allah ne is ka roza tum par farz nahin kiya. Main rozedar hun, tum mein se jo chahe roza rakhe, jo chahe iftar kare.'"
"632","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas Aashura ke din ka zikr hua. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Woh din tha jis mein zamana jahiliyat ke log roza rakhte. Tum mein se jo chahe roza rakhe, jo na pasand kare woh chhod de.'"
"633","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main nahin janta ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is din yani Aashura ke din ke siwa kisi din ka qasdan dosre dinon par roza rakha ho."
"634","[AI-translation] Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas tashreef lae. To main ne kaha: Ham ne Aap ke liye hais chhupa kar rakha hai. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Main ne roze ka irada kiya tha, lekin use qareeb karo.'"
"635","[AI-translation] Ummul Momineen Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas tashreef lae. To main ne kaha: Ham ne Aap ke liye hais tayyar kiya hai. Aap ne farmaya: 'Main ne roze ka irada kiya tha, lekin use qareeb karo.'"
"636","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Hafsa aur Sayyidah Aishah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karti hain ke un donon ne subah roze se ki. Din mein unhen kuch tohfe mein diya gaya to un donon ne iftar kar liya, aur unhon ne is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum donon is ke badle mein ek din roza rakho.' Ibn Juraij kahte hain: Main ne Ibn Shihab se poocha: Kya tum ne yeh Urwah bin Zubair se suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, balke mujhe Abdul Malik bin Marwan ke darwaze par khade ek aadmi ya Abdul Malik bin Marwan ki majlis ke ek aadmi ne is ki khabar di hai."
"637","[AI-translation] Ata bin Abi Rabah se riwayat hai ke Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) nafl roze mein iftar karne mein koi harj nahin samajhte the, aur is ke liye misalen dete the: 'Agar koi aadmi tawaf ke saat chakkar lagae lekin use mukammal na kare to use us ki niyat ke mutabiq sawab milega, ya kisi ne ek rak'at padhi aur doosri na padhi to use us ki niyat ke mutabiq sawab milega jise us ne sawab ki niyat se kiya.'"
"638","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar kahte hain ke Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) nafl roze mein iftar karne mein koi harj nahin samajhte the."
"639","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Sirin se riwayat hai ke in ke walid ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba ki ek jama'at ko waleema ki dawat di. To Sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) aae, aur in mein Ubayy bin Ka'b (Raziyallahu anhu) bhi the. Rawi kahte hain: Mera khayal hai unhon ne barkat ki dua ki aur phir chale gae."
"640","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Yazeed se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne Abdullah bin Umar ko dawat di. Woh aae aur baith gae, aur khana rakha gaya. To Abdullah bin Umar ne apna hath badhaya aur farmaya: 'Allah ke naam se lo.' Aur Abdullah ne apna hath rok liya aur farmaya: 'Main rozedar hun.'"
"641","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Abu Talhah ke ghar tashreef lae, aur Aap ke sath ek jama'at thi. To unhon ne in ke han khana khaya, aur woh waleema nahin tha."
"642","[AI-translation] Ata se, Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh aadhe din guzarne ya is se pahle apne ghar walon ke paas aate aur kahte: 'Kya nashta hai?' Woh use pate ya na pate, phir kahte: 'Main aaj zaroor roza rakhunga.' Phir woh roza rakhte, agarche woh iftar kiye hue hote aur woh waqt aa jata jabke woh iftar kiye hue hote."
"643","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke hamen khabar pahunchi ke woh bhi isi tarah karte the: Jab woh subah iftar kiye hue hote to chasht ya is ke baad tak, aur shayad unhen nashta milta ya na milta."
"644","[AI-translation] Ata bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne apni biwi ko bosa diya jabke woh rozedar tha. To use is se sakht pareshani hui. Phir us ne apni biwi ko is ke bare mein poochne bheja. To woh Ummul Momineen Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas aai aur unhen bataya. To Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: 'Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) roze ki haalat mein bosa dete.' To woh aurat apne shauhar ke paas wapas aai aur use bataya, magar is ne use aur pareshan kar diya. Us ne kaha: 'Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jaise nahin hain, Allah apne Rasool ke liye jo chahe halal karta hai.' To woh aurat Umm Salamah ke paas wapas aai aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko in ke paas paya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Is aurat ko kya hai?' To Umm Salamah ne Aap ko bataya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya tum ne use nahin bataya ke main yeh karta hun!' To Umm Salamah ne kaha: Main ne use bataya tha, phir woh apne shauhar ke paas gai to use aur pareshan kar diya. Us ne kaha: 'Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jaise nahin hain, Allah apne Rasool ke liye jo chahe halal karta hai.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) naraz hue phir farmaya: 'Allah ki qasam! Main tum mein sab se zyada Allah se darne wala aur Us ki hadon ko janne wala hun.'"
"645","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni baaz biwiyon ko roze ki haalat mein bosa dete, phir hanste."
"646","[AI-translation] Ata bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke Ibn Abbas se rozedar ke bosa ke bare mein poocha gaya. To unhon ne budhe ke liye is mein rukhsat di aur jawan ke liye ise makrooh samjha."
"647","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha jabke woh sun rahi thin: 'Main subah junbi uthta hun jabke roze ka irada rakhta hun.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main bhi subah junbi uthta hun jabke roze ka irada rakhta hun. Main ghusl karta hun phir us din roza rakhta hun.' Us aadmi ne kaha: 'Aap ham jaise nahin hain, Allah ne Aap ke agle pichhle gunah bakhsh diye hain.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) naraz hue aur farmaya: 'Allah ki qasam! Main tum mein sab se zyada Allah se darne wala aur is se bachne ko janne wala hone ki ummeed rakhta hun.'"
"648","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha jabke woh darwaze par khada tha aur main sun rahi thi: 'Ya Rasulullah! Main subah junbi uthta hun jabke roze ka irada rakhta hun.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main bhi subah junbi uthta hun jabke roze ka irada rakhta hun. Main ghusl karta hun pahle, aur phir main us din roza rakhta hun.'"
"649","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai ke main aur mere walid Madinah ke governor Marwan bin Hakam ke paas the, jab Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke bare mein zikr hua ke woh kahte hain: 'Jo subah junbi uthe woh us din iftar kare.' Marwan ne kaha: Aey Abdur Rahman! Main tumhen qasam deta hun ke Ummahatul Momineen Aishah aur Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas jao aur in se is ke bare mein poocho. Abu Bakr ne kaha: Abdur Rahman gae aur main bhi in ke sath gaya yahan tak ke ham Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas dakhil hue. Abdur Rahman ne unhen salam kiya aur kaha: Aey Ummul Momineen! Ham Marwan ke paas the aur hamare samne zikr hua ke Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Jo subah junbi uthe woh us din iftar karega.' To Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: 'Aey Abdur Rahman! Baat waisi nahin hai jaisi Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kahi hai. Kya tum us se munh modte ho jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) karte the?' Abdur Rahman ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam Aey Aishah! To Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par gawahi deti hun: Aap jima' se junbi subah karte baghair ehtelam ke, phir us din roza rakhte. Unhon ne kaha: Phir ham nikle yahan tak ke Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas dakhil hue aur unhon ne un se is ke bare mein poocha. To unhon ne waisa kaha jaisa Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha tha. Phir ham nikle yahan tak ke Marwan ke paas aae. To Abdur Rahman ne jo un donon ne kaha tha woh kaha aur use khabar di. To Marwan ne kaha: Main tumhen qasam deta hun Aey Abu Muhammad! Tum darwaze par meri sawari par sawar ho aur Abu Hurairah ke paas jao aur unhen is ki khabar do. To Abdur Rahman sawar hue aur main in ke sath sawar hua yahan tak ke ham Abu Hurairah ke paas aae. Abdur Rahman ne in se kuch der guftagu ki phir un se is ka zikr kiya. To Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Mujhe is ka ilm nahin, mujhe to ek khabar dene wale ne khabar di thi."
"650","[AI-translation] Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko subah pa leti jabke junbi hote to ghusl karte aur apne din ka roza rakhte."
"651","[AI-translation] Humaid bin Abdur Rahman se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Ramazan ke maheene mein iftar kar liya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use ghulam aazad karne, do maheene musalsal roze rakhne, ya saath miskeenon ko khana khilane ka hukm diya. To us ne kaha: 'Main taqat nahin rakhta.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas khajooron ka tokra laya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh le lo aur sadqa kar do.' To us ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Mujh se zyada koi mohtaj nahin.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hanse yahan tak ke Aap ki saamne ki danton nazar aane lage phir farmaya: 'Kha lo.' Shafi'i ne farmaya: Us ne jima' se iftar kiya tha."
"652","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya apne baal nochte hue, apna seena peette hue, aur kahta: Door wala halak ho gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ka kya hua? Us ne kaha: Main ne Ramazan mein roze ki haalat mein apni biwi se sohbat ki. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya tum ghulam aazad karne ki taqat rakhte ho?' Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya tum oont hadiya karne ki taqat rakhte ho?' Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: 'Baith jao.' Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas khajooron ka tokra laya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh le lo aur sadqa kar do.' Us ne kaha: 'Mujh se zyada koi mohtaj nahin pata.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Kha lo aur jo tum ne kiya is ke badle mein ek din roza rakho.' Ata ne kaha: To main ne Sa'id se poocha: Us tokre mein kitni khajooren thin? Unhon ne kaha: Pandrah sa' se bees tak."
"653","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se haamla aurat ke bare mein poocha gaya jab use apne bachche ka khadsha ho. Unhon ne kaha: Woh iftar kare aur har din ke badle mein ek miskeen ko ek mudd gandum khilaye."
"654","[AI-translation] Ash'as se, Shaddad bin Aus se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Fath ke zamane mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the. Phir Aap ne ek aadmi ko dekha jo Ramazan ke attharah din guzarne par paseena nikalwa raha tha. To Aap ne mera hath pakde hue farmaya: 'Paseena nikalne wale aur nikalwane wale donon ne iftar kar liya.'"
"655","[AI-translation] Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ehram ki haalat mein aur roze ki haalat mein paseena nikalwaya."
"656","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar roze ki haalat mein paseena nikalwate, phir unhon ne use chhod diya."
"657","[AI-translation] Khalid bin Aslam se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Ramazan mein badal wale din iftar kar liya aur samjha ke shaam ho gai hai aur suraj ghurub ho gaya hai. Phir in ke paas ek aadmi aaya aur kaha: Aey Ameerul Momineen! Suraj nikal aaya hai. To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Muamla aasan hai."
"658","[AI-translation] Rabi' ne kaha: Shafi'i ne farmaya: Jo roze ki haalat mein qai kare to us par qaza wajib hai, aur jise qai aa jae to us par qaza nahin hai."
"659","[AI-translation] Aur isi se Malik ne hamen Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se khabar di."
"660","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ko kahte suna: Mere zimme Ramazan ke roze hote magar main Sha'ban ke aane tak unhen rakhne ki taqat na pati."
